{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a533c0cb-e1fe-8a5f-96ee-48fe3b81a63e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:00:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I'm calling about a storm drain, a catch basin, at the corner near my house. It's totally clogged with leaves and every time it rains the water backs right up into my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:55:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. Let me grab a pen here. What's the address you're at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:55:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "396 Old Beach Road. That's the Easton's Beach side, down toward the water. The basin is at the corner, right by the end of my property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:55:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 396 Old Beach Road. And this is after the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter, Friday into Saturday. Two days ago. The water came up the driveway and just sat there. Sighs. As I said, it's the leaves. Nobody has cleared that basin, it's packed solid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:56:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the leaves come down and they plug those things up fast. Is the water in the house at all, or just the driveway and the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:56:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the driveway this time, and the edge of the yard. But it shouldn't be coming that close. I've got a car sitting in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So, catch basin at the corner of Old Beach, full of leaves, water backing into your driveway. Writing that down. Is it draining at all now, or is it still standing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's gone down now because it stopped raining, but that's not the point. The next time it rains it's going to do the exact same thing. My neighbor told me it happens every big rain. Every single one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so that's a known spot according to the neighbors. That helps, I'll put that in the notes so whoever picks it up knows it's a repeat problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:28-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. Because honestly, I'm calling from work right now, on my break, I'm in the break room at the bakery supply company, and I've got about ten minutes. I don't have time to keep calling about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, we'll make it quick. Can I get a name and a callback number, in case the foreman wants to confirm the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aisha Haddad. H-A-D-D-A-D. And the number is 401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aisha Haddad, 401-555-0199. Read that back, that's right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Now, which corner exactly? Is it the one on your side of the street, or across?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My side. The corner nearest to my driveway, on the beach end. You can't miss it, there's a pile of brown leaves sitting on top of the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Beach end, your side, leaves on the grate. That's pretty clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when is somebody coming out? I'd like to know. Do the crews work weekends? Because if it's going to rain again I'd like it cleared before then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:04-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do get out on weekends sometimes, mostly when it's storm cleanup or an emergency. For a clogged basin like this, it goes in the work order queue and they're pretty backed up right now after the storm. I'd say you're looking at a few days to a week, depending on what else comes in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. [pause] Okay. That's a long time with a forecast that I don't know yet. As I said, it's the same thing every time and nobody ever deals with it before it floods."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:53-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll mark it as a repeat location with water backing onto private property, which does bump it up a bit. If it starts to come toward the house or the garage, call us right back and say it's getting worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And who do I ask for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just ask for Public Works and mention the work order for 396 Old Beach Road. Whoever answers can pull it up. I'm putting it in right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, I guess. I have to get back to work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Thanks for calling, Aisha. Hope the rest of your Monday goes smoothly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
